<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/pretendard@1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.css">
{% set fs = [10.2, 9.7, 9.2, 8.8][density] %}
{% set lh = [1.55, 1.5, 1.45, 1.4][density] %}
<style>
  @page { size: A4; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; font-family: "Pretendard", "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Malgun Gothic", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif;
         font-size: {{ fs }}pt; line-height: {{ lh }}; color: #1b2330; }
  h1 { font-size: 16pt; margin: 0 0 2pt; color: #12213f; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .meta { font-size: 8.3pt; color: #667085; margin-bottom: 8pt; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 1pt 8pt; border-radius: 10pt; font-weight: 800; font-size: 9pt; color: #fff;
           background: {{ '#12806b' if decision == '투자' else '#b8650a' }}; margin-left: 6pt; vertical-align: 2pt; }
  h1 { font-size: 14.5pt; }
  ul.idea { margin: 2pt 0 4pt; padding-left: 14pt; } ul.idea li { margin: 1.5pt 0; }
  h2 { font-size: {{ fs + 2 }}pt; color: #12213f; margin: {{ [11, 9, 8, 7][density] }}pt 0 3pt; padding-bottom: 2pt;
       border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #d8dee9; break-after: avoid; }
  p { margin: 2pt 0 4pt; text-align: justify; }
  #summary { border: 1.6pt solid #12213f; border-radius: 6pt; padding: 7pt 11pt 6pt; background: #f5f7fb; }
  #summary h2 { margin-top: 0; border: none; font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  #summary ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 13pt; }
  #summary li { margin: 1.5pt 0; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: {{ fs - 1.2 }}pt; margin: 4pt 0 6pt; break-inside: auto; }
  th, td { border: 0.6pt solid #cfd6e2; padding: 2.5pt 5pt; vertical-align: top; text-align: left; }
  th { background: #eef2f8; font-weight: 700; }
  tr { break-inside: avoid; }
  td.yes { color: #12806b; font-weight: 800; text-align: center; } td.no { color: #b54708; font-weight: 800; text-align: center; }
  td.num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
  .total { font-weight: 800; background: #f5f7fb; }
  .small { font-size: {{ fs - 1.4 }}pt; color: #475467; }
  ol.refs { font-size: {{ fs - 1.8 }}pt; padding-left: 16pt; margin: 2pt 0; word-break: break-all; }
  ol.refs li { margin: 1pt 0; }
  ul.lim { margin: 2pt 0; padding-left: 14pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>{{ title }}<span class="badge">{{ badge }}</span></h1>
  <div class="meta">{{ domain }} · 중심 검토 대상 {{ profile.official_name }} ({{ profile.stage }}{% if profile.round_date %}, {{ profile.round_date }}{% endif %}) · 작성일 {{ run_date }}</div>

  <section id="summary">
    <h2>SUMMARY</h2>
    <ul>{% for s in draft.summary %}<li>{{ s }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
  </section>

  <h2>1. 사업 아이디어 — {{ profile.official_name }}</h2>
  <ul class="idea">
    <li><b>해결하는 문제</b> {{ draft.problem }}</li>
    <li><b>제품·핵심 컨셉</b> {{ draft.product }}</li>
    <li><b>수익 방식</b> {{ draft.revenue_model }}</li>
    <li><b>투자 단계</b> {{ profile.stage }} ({{ profile.round_date or '시점 미상' }}, {{ profile.round_amount or '금액 미공개' }})</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. 시장 규모와 성장성</h2>
  <p>{{ draft.market }}</p>

  <h2>3. 기술력과 팀</h2>
  <p>{{ draft.tech_team }}</p>
  <p><b>업계 기술 수준 대비</b> {{ draft.industry_baseline }}</p>

  <h2>4. 경쟁 구도</h2>
  <p>{{ draft.competition }}</p>
  <table>
    <tr><th style="width:17%">경쟁사</th><th style="width:9%">국가</th><th style="width:28%">제품·접근</th><th style="width:16%">규모</th><th>{{ '대상 대비' if c2_verified else '대상 대비 (회사 측 주장 포함)' }}</th></tr>
    {% for c in tables.competitors %}
    <tr><td>{{ c.name }}</td><td>{{ c.country }}</td><td>{{ c.offering }}</td><td>{{ c.scale }}</td><td>{{ c.vs_target }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>

  <h2>5. 사업 리스크</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th style="width:9%">유형</th><th style="width:50%">내용</th><th>실사 항목 · 투자 조건</th></tr>
    {% for r in draft.risks %}<tr><td>{{ r.type }}</td><td>{{ r.content }}</td><td>{{ r.due_diligence }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
  </table>

  <h2>6. 투자 판단 — {{ profile.official_name }} {{ decision }} ({{ scorecard.total }}점 / 기준 {{ scorecard.threshold }}점)</h2>
  <p>{{ draft.decision_rationale }}</p>
  <table>
    <tr><th style="width:27%">평가 항목 (Scorecard)</th><th style="width:9%">가중치</th><th style="width:13%">YES / 판정 문항</th><th style="width:10%">UNKNOWN</th><th style="width:9%">점수</th><th>비고</th></tr>
    {% for x in scorecard.dims %}
    <tr><td>{{ x.name }}</td><td class="num">{{ x.weight }}</td><td class="num">{{ x.yes }} / {{ x.n }}</td><td class="num">{{ x.unknown }}</td><td class="num">{{ x.score }}</td>
        <td>{% if loop.first %}UNKNOWN 비율 {{ (scorecard.unknown_ratio * 100) | round | int }}%{% endif %}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
    <tr class="total"><td>합계</td><td class="num">100</td><td></td><td></td><td class="num">{{ scorecard.total }}</td><td>기준점 민감도 60·70·80점: {{ scorecard.sensitivity['60'] }}·{{ scorecard.sensitivity['70'] }}·{{ scorecard.sensitivity['80'] }}</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p class="small"><b>판단 규칙</b> 총점 {{ scorecard.threshold }}점 이상, 창업자·시장성 통과율 50% 이상, Deal-killer 없음, UNKNOWN 40% 이하 → 투자.
  {% if scorecard.reasons %}<b>보류 사유</b> {{ scorecard.reasons | join(' / ') }}{% endif %}</p>
  <table class="small">
    <tr><th style="width:5%">ID</th><th style="width:40%">세부 질문 (YES 는 근거 원문 인용이 확인되어야 인정)</th><th style="width:9%">판정</th><th>근거·이유</th></tr>
    {% for r in tables.rows %}
    <tr><td>{{ r.qid }}</td><td>{{ r.question }}</td><td class="{{ 'yes' if r.answer == 'YES' else 'no' }}">{{ r.answer }}</td><td>{{ r.rationale }}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>
  {% if evals | length > 1 %}
  <table class="small">
    <tr><th>심층 평가 후보 (총점순)</th><th>분야</th><th>단계</th><th>총점</th><th>판단</th><th>보류 사유</th></tr>
    {% for e in evals %}<tr><td>{{ e.name }}</td><td>{{ e.segment_id }}</td><td>{{ e.stage }}</td><td class="num">{{ e.total }}</td><td>{{ e.decision }}</td><td>{{ e.knockouts | join(', ') }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
  </table>
  {% endif %}

  <h2>7. 한계점</h2>
  <ul class="lim">{% for x in draft.limitations %}<li>{{ x }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>

  <h2>REFERENCE</h2>
  <ol class="refs">{% for r in refs %}<li value="{{ r.n }}">{{ r.text }}</li>{% endfor %}</ol>
</body>
</html>
